    "type": "DOCUMENT",
    "description": "10 slide",
    "content": "<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/CHS301/flm1/d78/001.webp\" alt=\"CHS301 · 80.B15.5 · slide 1: 第15课\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"721\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">80.B15.5 · slide 1/10</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>第15课<br>谁能说自己不喜欢艺术</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/CHS301/flm1/d78/002.webp\" alt=\"CHS301 · 80.B15.5 · slide 2: 复习\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"721\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">80.B15.5 · slide 2/10</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>复习<br>我喜欢流行音乐</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/CHS301/flm1/d78/003.webp\" alt=\"CHS301 · 80.B15.5 · slide 3: 练习\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"721\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">80.B15.5 · slide 3/10</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>练习<br>① 为 “旋律、色彩、图案、故事” 找到合适的形容词。<br>______的旋律<br>______的色彩<br>______的图案<br>______的故事</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/CHS301/flm1/d78/004.webp\" alt=\"CHS301 · 80.B15.5 · slide 4: 练习\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"721\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">80.B15.5 · slide 4/10</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>练习<br>从课文里选择恰当的词语或句子填空。<br>① 去吃印度菜？太好了，________________________，我也想去吃印度菜。<br>② 那本小说很有意思，________________________。<br>③ 我非常喜欢《卡萨布兰卡》里的音乐，听了多少遍都不腻，<br>真是________________________。<br>④ 我没有时间，也没有钱，而且对这个地方也没兴趣，<br>________________________我不想去。<br>如果你需要，我可以帮你补全这些题目的参考答案，要我直接写出来吗？</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/CHS301/flm1/d78/005.webp\" alt=\"CHS301 · 80.B15.5 · slide 5: 对话练习\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"721\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">80.B15.5 · slide 5/10</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>对话练习<br>内容：以下给你提供一些艺术的宣传海报。这个星期你和朋友不用上课所以你详情他跟你去参加其中一个。<br>请跟朋友一起商量看看你们回去看哪个？</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/CHS301/flm1/d78/006.webp\" alt=\"CHS301 · 80.B15.5 · slide 6\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"721\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">80.B15.5 · slide 6/10</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/CHS301/flm1/d78/007.webp\" alt=\"CHS301 · 80.B15.5 · slide 7\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"721\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">80.B15.5 · slide 7/10</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/CHS301/flm1/d78/008.webp\" alt=\"CHS301 · 80.B15.5 · slide 8\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"721\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">80.B15.5 · slide 8/10</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/CHS301/flm1/d78/009.webp\" alt=\"CHS301 · 80.B15.5 · slide 9\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"721\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">80.B15.5 · slide 9/10</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/CHS301/flm1/d78/010.webp\" alt=\"CHS301 · 80.B15.5 · slide 10: 谢谢！\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"721\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">80.B15.5 · slide 10/10</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>谢谢！<br>谢谢！</p></div>"
